From: Yassine Oudjana <y.oudjana@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jun 2022 11:09:46 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: wcd9335: Add AIF4_CAP

WCD9335 has a fourth capture DAI. Define it in DT bindings.

Signed-off-by: Yassine Oudjana <y.oudjana@protonmail.com>
---
 include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,wcd9335.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,wcd9335.h b/include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,wcd9335.h
index 4fc68aeb9e..22585d3030 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,wcd9335.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,wcd9335.h
@@ -10,5 +10,6 @@
 #define AIF3_PB                 4
 #define AIF3_CAP                5
 #define AIF4_PB                 6
+#define AIF4_CAP                7
 
 #endif
